Dear colleagues,

since there seems to be no way around me learning RRPP, I have been tackling the available manuals and vignettes. I do have some questions remaining and I hope that I may ask them here.

When I am passing a "geomorph.data.frame" (that contains results from gpagen along with factors) to RRPP and try to run a model on the coordinates in this data frame, I get the following error message: "Data are arranged in an array rather than a matrix. Please convert data to a matrix." Might you know of any function that can convert the geomorph data frames (which are in an array format) into a "palatable" matrix for RRPP?

Thank you for your help!

Cheers
Bob

